stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> reserved: prepare 登记候选
  reserved --> prepared: 上传 + 回读验 hash
  reserved --> abandoned: 失败 / 搁浅 / 被取代
  prepared --> committed: commit 一次 CAS(切客户指针)
  prepared --> abandoned: 否决 / 搁浅 / 被同版本赢家取代
  committed --> [*]
  abandoned --> [*]: 对象走 expire→tombstone→delete 回收
